sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Coordinator Fiber
    participant T as Transaction
    participant Q0 as shard_queue 0
    participant Q1 as shard_queue 1
    participant S0 as EngineShard 0
    participant S1 as EngineShard 1

    C->>T: ScheduleInternal()
    T->>T: 分配全局 TxId
    par schedule
      T->>Q0: Add(ScheduleInShard)
      Q0->>S0: intent lock + txq insert
    and
      T->>Q1: Add(ScheduleInShard)
      Q1->>S1: intent lock + txq insert
    end
    S0-->>T: FinishHop
    S1-->>T: FinishHop
    T-->>C: run_barrier ready
    alt 任一 shard 检测乱序冲突
      C->>T: CancelShardCb on active shards
      T->>T: InitTxTime / 新 TxId
      C->>T: retry
    end
